    "description": "Wipro Capital India is actively seeking a talented and motivated Full Stack Developer to join our dynamic team in Ranchi. This is an excellent opportunity for professionals who are passionate about making a real impact in a fast-growing organization.\n\nAbout Wipro Capital India:\nWipro Capital India is a leading organization in the Hybrid sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Write and execute unit tests and integration tests\n• Collaborate with cross-functional teams including product, design, and QA\n• Write clean, maintainable, and well-documented code\n• Implement new features based on product requirements\n• Integrate third-party APIs and services\n• Optimize application performance and ensure high availability\n• Troubleshoot, debug, and resolve software defects and performance issues\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Chartered Accountant (ICAI)\n• 10-15 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Agile/Scrum\n• Proficiency in Node.js\n• Proficiency in Go\n• Proficiency in Machine Learning\n• Proficiency in React\n• Proficiency in TensorFlow\n• Proficiency in CI/CD\n• Proficiency in Git\n\nWork Mode: Hybrid - Flexible work-from-home and office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Recognition and rewards programs\n• Company-sponsored certifications\n• Modern office with recreational facilities\n• International travel opportunities for senior roles\n• Meal coupons and food allowance\n• Work-from-home flexibility\n• Salary Range: 20 LPA - 40 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Ranchi, Jharkhand, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Wipro Capital India!",
